			"date": "2022-04-22T15:26:30.000Z",
			"content": "Yeah! That was a Q&amp;A question that came up too—personally I like to use Serverless for ODB (and repeat cached requests don’t go towards the quota). On the other hand, Edge invocations are never cached so your usage will likely be higher there!\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/EleventyMeetup\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/SCRWD\"></a>",
