			},
			"date": "2022-04-22T15:39:57.000Z",
			"content": "This looks like a great feature. I have a site built on an old custom static framework I’d like to migrate. <a href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\">@eleven_ty</a> seems like a perfect fit so I’ve been reading up. The site already uses ejs templates and <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Netlify\">@Netlify</a> functions so the transition seems logical 🤘\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/EleventyMeetup\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
