			"content": "Maybe a bug with aspect-ratio and obtrusive scrollbars? Mac OS + Firefox right? Seems to be working over here on FF 99 and FF Nightly—even across the different scrollbar OS preferences\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/simevidas\"></a>",
